# (f) Create a React component that displays the current date and time dynamically

```jsx
function App() {
  const today = new Date();

  return (
    <div>
      <h2>Current Date and Time</h2>
      <p>{today.toLocaleDateString()}</p>
      <p>{today.toLocaleTimeString()}</p>
    </div>
  );
}

export default App;
```

